    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm working on a paper about how much control countries are actually losing because of all these international trade deals and stuff. can u write a quick intro paragraph for me that explains why many people feel like these globalist policies are making it impossible for individual nations to actually look out for their own workers and interests?",
